  "reason": "The strongest evidence so far is RNA-only PCA with multiprofile avgpool (0.591 acc / 0.573 F1), while image-only ResNet with singleprofile is weak (0.208 acc / 0.172 F1). It is unclear whether the image modality can contribute at all or whether the multiprofile avgpool benefit seen in RNA is general. config_011 tests image-only ResNet with multiprofile avgpool, directly extending config_010 and mirroring the profile/aggregation setting of the best RNA result. This is the best next experiment because it isolates the effect of profile setting and aggregation for the image modality, reducing uncertainty about whether multimodal or image-based extensions are worth further budget."
}

